# Repository-wide line-ending policy: normalize all text files to LF in the
# repository and on checkout, regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting. This was introduced in Phase 1 after Phase 0 found
# that `npm run format:check` failed on ~109 files purely because Windows
# checkouts (git config core.autocrlf=true) convert the LF blobs already
# stored in git to CRLF on disk, which Prettier (default endOfLine: "lf")
# then flags as unformatted. No file content changes with this policy.
* text=auto eol=lf
